L.cost.2024"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2025 was China: €9.5 billion, 29% of revenue.","cites":["ASML.mix.geography.2025.0","ASML.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest product line or market in FY2025 was NXE: €10.4 billion, 32% of revenue.","cites":["ASML.mix.product.2025.0","ASML.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2025 report tags the group it labels “Four customers” at 61% of revenue.","cites":["ASML.conc.2025.0"]}]}}